## RelationType: 任职于

医生可以同时在多个科室任职，任职记录在任职表中，一行一段任职（含职务与起止日期）。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| doctor | department | indirect |

### Backing Resource

| Type | ID |
|------|----|
| resource | res_doctor_assignment |

### Source Mapping

| Source Property | Resource Property |
|-----------------|-------------------|
| doctor_id | doctor_id |

### Target Mapping

| Resource Property | Target Property |
|-------------------|-----------------|
| dept_code | dept_id |

